<title>GERMANY: Buba says Jan adjusted jobless rate 11.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba says Jan adjusted jobless rate 11.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank reported the following seasonally adjusted unemployment rates (pct).</p>
<p>PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT Jan 97 Dec 96 Jan 96</p>
<p> Rate				 11.3	 10.9	10.0 WEST</p>
<p>GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				  9.8	  9.6	 8.7 EAST</p>
<p>GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				 17.3	 16.2	15.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Labour Office earlier reported the bulk of the jobless figures. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
